Development ECDSA P-256 MCUboot signing key for desk, docker west, and phone OTA.

  zephyr/mcuboot/root-ec-p256.pem

ECDSA (not RSA-2048): ESP32-S3 MCUboot IRAM cannot fit mbedTLS RSA verify
plus the board DTS. One key for common development. Rotate only after
compromise or a rare re-factory: `imgtool keygen -t ecdsa-p256 -k root-ec-p256.pem`,
rebuild MCUboot + app, USB-flash mcuboot.bin @ 0x0 and the signed confirmed
slot image @ 0x10000 (flash-zephyr.sh handshake).

Do not use MCUboot's upstream `root-ec-p256.pem` — that private key is public.
USB recovery always remains the fallback if an OTA slot is marked bad.
